        {
          "@value": "Same-site scripts the IG's own pages load, as each page's script `src` writes them (owner, 2026-11-12, cards Q-TRP-3 and Q-RAIL-2). The injection gate (`scripts/ig-content-qa.ts`) accepts, on a page and only there, a script element whose `src` is on this list and that has no body; every other script, and any script in a resource's narrative or markdown, is still refused. Absent means none.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "fhir-harness/schemas/ig-content-type.ts#IgSection.trustedScripts",
